                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Like most people who use this platform, I own WAY too many games i've never played. to combat this, i added all my games to a wheel and gave them as long as I could. Here is my take for this game:\r\nThis game is cute and a lot of fun. Top-down shooting puzzle game seems a fair explanation. The story doesn't take itself too seriously which really makes it enjoyable. I'm coming back to this one sometime. 6/10",
